# HDR transfer functions (PQ / HLG) add content-light-level and mastering-display side data to the video stream (not
# observable in the TS bytes; the start must simply succeed with a 10-bit format), 4.1 audio selects an explicit layout,
# an unknown audio codec name fails the stream set-up.
create
world vformat p010
world colorspace pq
start
events
pkt v 0 0 0 1 3000
pkt a 0 0 0 1 200
drain
stop 0
events
world colorspace hlg
start
events
stop 0
world colorspace 709
world vformat nv12
world speakers 4.1
start
events
stop 0
world speakers stereo
world acodec nonexistent
start
events
